{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"alias":"shortish-unholy-finwhale","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nBug 3781-9cec-5cf5-46be stopped scenario_4 of infra/gerrit/feature-branch-e2e-scenarios.sh claiming a Verified rerun it only recorded. Proving the rerun needs a live run.\n\n## Approach\nIn a session with admin and feature-driver rights, observe whether Verified is absent right after the re-merge push and returns to the maximum once CI reruns; if the behaviour is stable, add that assertion to scenario_4 with a bounded poll, and extend the stubbed test.\n\n## Testing\nA live run of feature-branch-e2e.sh with SCENARIOS=4, output recorded on this task.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A live scenario 4 run records Verified absent after the re-merge push and back at the maximum after CI (checked: run output recorded in a ticket comment).\n","id":"c74a-422f-c35c-492f","parent_id":"","priority":4,"tags":["gerrit","e2e","verification"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Make e2e scenario 4 prove a Verified rerun against live Gerrit"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1792921665033549001,"uuid":"ddd3d996-141d-4835-95db-a14600cf6187"}